searched *first*, and so any custom DLLs there will be loaded before
searching the rest of the path.

Multiple DLLs can be loaded if some program has a custom version in it's
path and some other program is using a different (be it system or
otherwise).  It still isn't a solution to the problem, though, because 
a DLL in a custom path isn't shared anymore...

