Christopher,

You have stumbled on the Red Hat Alpha/Linux distribution gotcha: Netscape
has not been ported to the Alpha architecture under native Linux.  The
sources of the browser are available (at least) on the Intel/Linux
distribution together with the executable (for the Intel processor).  With
the source available, you might try porting the software yourself.  I
cannot remember whether those sources are also available on the Alpha/Linux
source CD in the Red Hat 6.0 distribution.  When this type of question has
been asked before, others have mentioned using the Netscape executable
available on the Web for Alpha/Tru64.  But I cannot remember the details of
that process.

Ross

