How did you determine that your problems were related to DLL
conflicts?

>
>I've been using Unix professionally for about 18 years, twelve of that
>(at least) as a sysadmin.  The only problem I've ever had with libraries
>was when a new program I downloaded wouldn't run because I didn't have
>a more up to date version.  Download the newer version, the program
