> SPECfp95 (egcs-1.1.2)
> Intel PIII/600    12,4
> Athlon 600        17,5
> Alpha 500        22,8
> When using Digital Visual Fortran V6.0a it looked like this
> SPECfp95
> Intel PIII/600    14,7
> Athlon 600        21,0
