> The other SPEC benches were done with Microsoft MSC 6.0
> SPECint95
> Intel PIII/600    20,0
> Athlon 600        21,6
> Alpha 500        21,2
> or Intel Fortran and C/C++ Compilers respectively, so there was no Alpha in
