Simplified..
Right now, DMA space is directly mapped from the PCI  bus to part of main
memory . The preferred method is the use Scatter/gather mapping which would
remove the 2gb memory limit.

This 2Gig limit is only there because PCI drivers currently use the direct
mapping of DMA's instead of Scatter/Gather..    I believe they are working
to find the best method to modify the drivers to work across all platforms
as re:-1 stated.     I know the Qlogic was already converted using one
method and it worked.

JJ


